  "description": "After going back in time using magic to save her mom from the evil emperor, Bebe finally wakes up at the manor of Xenox Ablant, an archduke with strong powers and an even stronger repulsion of the emperor. Some call him crazy, but Bebe believes he would be the perfect stepdad to protect herself and her mom. However, not everyone at the manor is friendly to them, and the threats to their lives only continue. Will Bebe be able to adjust to her new life and protect her loved ones once and for all? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
